 8. 📱 1 fun thing: SNL moguls 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 NBC via YouTube Bowen Yang made a surprise return cameo as Jensen Huang in the "Saturday Night Live" cold open last night. The "CIA Headquarters" sketch included portrayals of Elon Musk, Mark Zuckerberg, Dario Amodei, Sam Altman and Peter Thiel. 

 John Mulaney, the night's guest host, played a CIA briefer warning the moguls that the Venn diagram of "Beautiful women" who want to have sex with them and lap up "Your interests and opinions" is ... "Spy." NBC via YouTube Watch it here . 

 
 
